// PAS-DEBT-B2-010b Slice B (#1541, v0.36.65) — round-trip fixture.
//
// Three-fragment macro exercising three DIFFERENT fragment kinds
// (ident, literal, expr) in one pattern, with the corresponding
// references interleaved with literal template text. Under Slice B,
// `bind_local(counter, 0, counter + 1)` composes into
// `{ let counter = 0; counter + 1 }`.
//
// This is the maximal cross-kind fixture for Slice B round-trip
// coverage: it validates that MacroFragmentKind::{Ident, Literal,
// Expr} all round-trip through the parser's structured
// template_elems output and the elaborator's expand_macro
// substitution.
//
// End-to-end code-emission coverage waits on the macro-driver work
// (PAS-DEBT-B7-001, #1529).

module M = structure {
  macro bind_local($name:ident, $init:literal, $body:expr) => { { let $name = $init; $body } }
}
